  "content": "# 第34题\n\n**题型**: 选择题\n\n**难度**: ★★★☆☆\n\n**分值**: 2分\n\n---\n\n## 题目内容\n\nWhich would be the best title for the passage?\n\n## 选项\n\nA. A. Life Is Undefined. Can AI Be a Way Out?\n\nB. B. Life Evolves. Can AI Help ALife Evolve, Too?\n\nC. C. Life Is Undefined. Can ALife Be Defined One Day?\n\nD. D. Life Evolves. Can Attempts to Create ALife Evolve, Too?\n\n---\n\n## 参考答案\n\nD\n\n",
  "answer": "C",
  "analysis": "本题考查主谓一致。主语‘The teacher together with his students’中，中心词是‘The teacher’，为单数，故谓语用单数，且根据语境用一般现在时，选C。"
